{"scene_id": "s01676", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01676.fountain", "heading": "INT. ORBITAL GREENHOUSE RING - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "CAPTAIN ISADORA QUILL", "names": ["CAPTAIN ISADORA QUILL", "ISADORA"], "gender": "?", "first": 4, "spoke": 3}, {"id": 1, "name": "HIRO TANABE", "names": ["HIRO TANABE", "HIRO"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 2}, {"id": 2, "name": "ENSIGN PELL OKONKWO", "names": ["ENSIGN PELL OKONKWO", "PELL"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 2}, {"id": 3, "name": "MARIGOLD SENN", "names": ["MARIGOLD SENN", "MARIGOLD"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 2}, {"id": 4, "name": "BARNABY CROSS", "names": ["BARNABY CROSS", "BARNABY"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 1}, {"id": 5, "name": "UNIT SEVEN", "names": ["UNIT SEVEN"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 1}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ORBITAL GREENHOUSE RING - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A curved corridor of hydroponic racks, lit violet.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Vines trail from brackets.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Condensation drips from the ceiling in slow, floating beads.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "CAPTAIN ISADORA QUILL (50s, severe, silver crop) grips a handrail.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Behind her, DR. HIRO TANABE (40s, lab coat), ENSIGN PELL OKONKWO (20s), and the ring's botanist, MARIGOLD SENN (30s, soil-stained gloves), crowd the hatch.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "At the far end, the old engineer BARNABY CROSS (60s) and a maintenance bot, UNIT SEVEN, stand beside a red warning light.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Status.", "name": "ISADORA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Spore bloom in Racks Four through Nine --", "name": "HIRO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's not a bloom, it's a --", "name": "MARIGOLD", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Captain, the seal on Nine is --", "name": "PELL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "One at a time!", "name": "ISADORA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Seal's gone. Nine's venting.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Atmospheric loss at six percent and climbing.", "name": "UNIT SEVEN", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": ["synthetic"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We have minutes.", "name": "HIRO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Less if the roots reach the coolant.", "name": "MARIGOLD", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then we cut Nine loose!", "name": "PELL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Do it.", "name": "ISADORA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Barnaby slams a lever.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "The red light dies.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Everyone exhales together.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}]}